#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:5
#: cba6dadc0874470494ece794b9bdc2e0
msgid "AirPixel ENTIRE R3 for Camera Control and EXIF Geotagging"
msgstr "AirPixel ENTIRE R3 相机控制与 EXIF 地理标记"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:11
#: 1c56c178934e4799bb245dbedac3bef5
msgid ""
"The `ENTIRE R3 <https://airpixel.cz/entire-r3>`_ is a standalone device for "
"GeoTagging of images in-camera SD card.  GPS data data is read from the "
"autopilot's serial port (aka MAVLink bus) and is then saved directly into "
"the photos using EXIF. The ENTIRE can also trigger the camera shutter via "
"MAVLink commands, control video recording and zoom and many other commands."
msgstr ""
"`ENTIRE R3 <https://airpixel.cz/entire-r3>`_ 是一款用于在相机 SD "
"卡中对图像进行地理标记的独立设备。GPS 数据从飞控的串口（即 MAVLink 总线）读取，然后直接通过 EXIF 保存到照片中。ENTIRE "
"还可以通过 MAVLink 命令触发相机快门、控制视频录制和变焦以及许多其他命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:13
#: d971c586037242748b50468a80775f81
msgid "Compatible with Sony A7 series, A9 Series and many other Sony models"
msgstr "兼容 Sony A7 系列、A9 系列及其他众多 Sony 型号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:14
#: 4023da4083f14603800a729e10f90eff
msgid "Compatible also with ADTi cameras, ShareUAV cameras or ViewPro cameras"
msgstr "也兼容 ADTi 相机、ShareUAV 相机或 ViewPro 相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:15
#: 1a9d6e078f04430481d93d24d72f0d4c
msgid ""
"Photos are tagged (via EXIF) with the lat, lon, altitude and camera angles "
"(read from the gimbal) within the camera"
msgstr "照片在相机内通过 EXIF 标记纬度、经度、高度和相机角度（从云台读取）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:16
#: df0853de5ddc4e6ca08365828bd82dd8
msgid ""
"Optional geotagging of GPS/IMU accuracy, laser rangefinder and many more"
msgstr "可选地理标记 GPS/IMU 精度、激光测距仪等更多信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:17
#: c0f25b7f90f04e45968679c5ff756a59
msgid ""
"HereLink implementation for camera control via MavCam (`more info "
"<https://airpixel.cz/herelink-camera-control-geotagging/>`_)"
msgstr ""
"通过 MavCam 在 HereLink 上实现相机控制（`更多信息 <https://airpixel.cz/herelink-camera-"
"control-geotagging/>`_）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:18
#: 422c1027d22f475192552479ce190102
msgid "Mission Planner implementation via plugin"
msgstr "通过插件在 Mission Planner 中实现"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:19
#: f2b01db8f84440b597d9fe6530eda557
msgid "Supports taking pictures by distance flown or at intervals"
msgstr "支持按飞行距离或时间间隔拍照"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:20
#: 2f9fe3b6d4a9457686917d0752f66caf
msgid ""
"Optionally uses configurable GPS position offset (X,Y,Z) to improve accuracy"
" by lever arm calculations"
msgstr "可选使用可配置的 GPS 位置偏移（X、Y、Z）通过杠杆臂计算提高精度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:21
#: a4171fcb50cc4ef4a8133b74b092568e
msgid "High accuracy of EXIF saving - 1mm in distance"
msgstr "EXIF 保存精度高——精确到 1mm"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:22
#: 82b7190a336240e0a9609d601a0935b2
msgid "Geotagging available for JPG and RAW"
msgstr "支持对 JPG 和 RAW 格式进行地理标记"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:23
#: 42622bf6e21844d19e9a42930280b704
msgid "Hot-shoe sync connector for reduced errors"
msgstr "热靴同步连接器，减少误差"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:24
#: 1c9c363218084768af90f725c4ca7653
msgid ""
"GeoTagging is available at the *maximum speed of the camera* (even lower "
"than 1s)"
msgstr "地理标记可在*相机最高速度*下进行（甚至低于 1 秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:25
#: b2501315c5824c18ad18f7170232bbaa
msgid "WiFi configuration and simple firmware updates"
msgstr "WiFi 配置和简便固件更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:27
#: ad6f866a1a504660938eeb81731770b6
msgid ""
"More info at `www.airpixel.cz <https://airpixel.cz/photogrammetry/>`_ "
"Documentation at `www.airpixel.cz/docs <https://airpixel.cz/docs>`_"
msgstr ""
"更多信息请访问 `www.airpixel.cz <https://airpixel.cz/photogrammetry/>`_ 文档请访问 "
"`www.airpixel.cz/docs <https://airpixel.cz/docs>`_"
